# ID       : ABOP-020
# Name     : Peano/FASS curve on diagonal contacts
# Source   : chapter 1, book page 17, Fig. 1.17a
# Formalism: deterministic turtle string
# Parse    : pass
# Execute  : pass
#
# Original ABOP:
# ABOP | ω : L
# ABOP | p1    : L -> LFRFL-F-RFLFR+F+LFRFL
# ABOP | p2    : R -> RFLFR+F+LFRFL-F-RFLFR
